items/cor-euclidean-compactness-equivalence-chart.md:38:[L3] The topological and metric readings of compactness for a Euclidean subspace agree ([[thm-compactness-agrees-with-metric-compactness]]); the named topological variants have the meanings of [[def-compactness-variants]].
